=== Easy way ===

Fresh machine setup:

    ./fresh-install.sh

Rebuild after first setup:

    ./rebuild.sh
    

=== Actual Nix commands ===

To build & configure system:

    sudo darwin-rebuild switch --flake ~/nix#cooked

Or boostrap nix-darwin

    sudo nix run nix-darwin/master#darwin-rebuild -- switch --flake ~/nix#cooked

Or to just load preference files:

    python3 ./load-prefs.py
    
